            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>0</code> misafir sayısı için ikinci işleyiciyi tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"bill.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"48\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"guests = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  share = total / guests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" TypeError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Use numbers&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ZeroDivisionError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Add a guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Add a guest\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>ZeroDivisionError</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
