          {
            "title": "Keep Specific Handlers First",
            "id": 152095,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod hakkında doğru olan nedir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid value&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Other failure&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Özelleştirilmiş yanıtı erişilebilir, yedek seçeneği ise en sonda tutar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Özelleştirilmiş yanıtı erişilebilir tutar ve önce yedek seçeneği ekler</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Özelleştirilmiş yanıtı erişilebilir tutar ve geri dönüş seçeneği yoktur</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Özelleştirilmiş yanıtı erişilebilir, yedek seçeneği ise en sonda tutar.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu işleyiciler bir <code>try</code> bloğundan sonra geliyor. Blok <code>ValueError</code> oluşturursa hangi mesajlar yazdırılır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid value&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Other failure&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Yalnızca Invalid value.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca Other failure.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Invalid value, ardından Other failure.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Belirli bir işleyiciden sonra genel bir işleyici gelemediği için hiçbir mesaj.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Yalnızca Invalid value.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Catch Missing Data",
            "id": 152096,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Eksik <code>\"role\"</code> anahtarı için ikinci işleyiciyi tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"profile.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"record = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  role = record[\" /><text value=\"&quot;role&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing field&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Missing field\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>KeyError</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Eksik alanı okumayı dene ve eksik anahtar hatasını işle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"profile.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"record = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  role = record[\" /><text value=\"&quot;role&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing field&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Missing field\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"role\"</code>, ardından <code>KeyError</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
